# Oil & Gas Cycle Dashboard - pipeline credentials
#
# Copy to .env for local runs (.env is gitignored and must never be committed).
# In CI these are GitHub Actions repository secrets - see README, "Turning the
# pipeline on". Every key is read from process.env at run time; none of them are
# ever written into data/*.json or shipped to the browser.
#
# NOTHING here is required for the series that are already live. Brent, WTI, the
# Indian crude basket and USD/INR all come from key-free public endpoints, so a
# fork with no secrets at all still refreshes those four.

# --- Screener.in session (company financials, concalls, KPIs) -------------
# Driven with Playwright. Used to reach the logged-in quarterly tables and the
# concall documents.
#
# Set the PAID pair if the account is subscribed: only a subscribed account can
# read concall AI Summaries, which are the densest source the KPI extractor has
# (one summary per quarter). The paid pair wins whenever both of its values are
# present; the free pair below stays supported as a fallback, so the pipeline
# still runs on a fork or if the subscription lapses.
SCREENER_PAID_EMAIL=
SCREENER_PAID_PASSWORD=

SCREENER_EMAIL=
SCREENER_PASSWORD=

# --- Scraping fallbacks (prompt 3+: pages that block a plain fetch) -------
# Needed for the three macro series still marked "awaiting": Singapore GRM,
# domestic gas (APM + JKM) and the Baltic Dirty Tanker index. Set either one -
# the fetcher tries Firecrawl first, then Scrape.do, then gives up honestly.
FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=
SCRAPEDO_API_KEY=

# --- LLM providers (prompt 6: management commentary tone) -----------------
# pipeline/lib/llm.mjs is provider-agnostic; set whichever you use.
# OpenAI supports strict json_schema, Mistral supports json_object.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
MISTRAL_API_KEY=

# --- Claude via AWS Bedrock (additive, pipeline/lib/llm-bedrock.mjs) -------
# Inert unless LLM_PROVIDER=claude - unset (or any other value) always runs
# the OpenAI path above unchanged. Flip LLM_PROVIDER to try Claude instead.
LLM_PROVIDER=
CLAUDE_BEDROCK_API_KEY=
BEDROCK_REGION=
BEDROCK_MODEL_ID=
